{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27797","headline":"秦原道中 · 欧阳衮","name":"秦原道中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分险架长澜，斜梁控夕峦。\n宿云依岭断，初月入江寒。\n缁化秦裘敝，尘惊汉策残。\n无言倦行旅，遥路属时难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27797.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27797","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}